title: "WGU D610 Capstone: Synthetic Health Data Processing Pipeline Performance Analysis"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2025-11-12
url: "https://github.com/rcmiller01/wgu-capstone"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rcmiller01/wgu-capstone"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - health data
  - FHIR
  - data pipeline
  - synthetic data
  - performance analysis
  - serverless computing
abstract: >
  This project implements and evaluates a serverless FHIR data processing
  pipeline that integrates synthetic health data from multiple sources
  (Synthea, NHANES, VDH, NIH). The analysis examines pipeline validation
  pass rates across data sources, processing latency distribution and
  determinants, impact of data quality flags on performance metrics, and
  statistical comparison of processing outcomes.
